      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/97f17d/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-06-26T00:59:21.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Danger Sense: Legacy is immune to damage <strong>from </strong>environment cards.</p><p>Cramped Quarters: [ . . . ] Increase all damage dealt by 1.</p><p><span>So Cramped quarters is not dealing any damage itself, just increasing any other instances of damage. &nbsp;I do agree, however, that Danger Sense would be clearer if it read \"immune to damage <strong>dealt by</strong> environment cards.\"</span></p>",
